ON)</span></li><li class=3D"c8 c27 li-bullet-0"><span class=3D"c6">GET K:</=
span><span>&nbsp;Returns the latest committed value of key K. If K doesn=E2=
=80=99t exist in the database, an empty string will be returned as value by=
 default</span><span class=3D"c1">. (READ OPERATION)</span></li></ol><p cla=
ss=3D"c9"><span class=3D"c1"></span></p><p class=3D"c12"><span class=3D"c1"=
>Apart from the abovementioned operations, a node can also initiate an empt=
