=3D"c13 c27 c35 li-bullet-0"><span class=3D"c2">Leader Information:</span><=
/li></ol><ol class=3D"c0 lst-kix_f1ej2jkhho2v-1 start" start=3D"1"><li clas=
s=3D"c13 c18 li-bullet-0"><span class=3D"c1">The client stores the IP addre=
sses and ports of all the nodes.</span></li><li class=3D"c13 c18 li-bullet-=
0"><span class=3D"c1">The client stores the current leader ID, although thi=
s information might get outdated.<br></span></li></ol><ol class=3D"c0 lst-k=
ix_f1ej2jkhho2v-0" start=3D"2"><li class=3D"c13 c35 c27 li-bullet-0"><span =
