d4g04go"><span class=3D"c6">5</span><span class=3D"c29 c6">. Election Funct=
ionalities</span></h2><p class=3D"c21"><span class=3D"c1">Nodes must implem=
ent the following functionality with regard to the leader election process.=
</span></p><p class=3D"c21 c22"><span class=3D"c1"></span></p><ol class=3D"=
c0 lst-kix_fpy1luvoz4gw-0 start" start=3D"1"><li class=3D"c10 li-bullet-0">=
<span class=3D"c2">Start Election: </span></li></ol><ol class=3D"c0 lst-kix=
_fpy1luvoz4gw-1 start" start=3D"1"><li class=3D"c12 c18 li-bullet-0"><span =
class=3D"c1">All follower nodes keep an election timer and listen to either=
 the heartbeat event or a request for a vote event. </span></li><li class=
=3D"c12 c18 li-bullet-0"><span>The election timeout should be</span><span>&=
nbsp;</span><span class=3D"c6">randomized</span><span class=3D"c6">&nbsp;</=
span><span>(</span><span>5-10 seconds</span><span class=3D"c1">) to prevent=
 multiple candidates from starting the election.</span></li><li class=3D"c1=
2 c18 li-bullet-0"><span class=3D"c1">If no event is received in this durat=
ion, the node converts to a candidate, increments the term number, and send=
s vote requests to other nodes.</span></li><li class=3D"c12 c18 li-bullet-0=
"><span class=3D"c1 c20">While receiving votes, the candidate must keep tra=
ck of the maximum old leader lease duration received from voters.</span></l=
i></ol><p class=3D"c9"><span class=3D"c1"></span></p><ol class=3D"c0 lst-ki=
x_fpy1luvoz4gw-0" start=3D"2"><li class=3D"c10 li-bullet-0"><span class=3D"=
c2">Receive Voting Request</span></li></ol><ol class=3D"c0 lst-kix_fpy1luvo=
z4gw-1 start" start=3D"1"><li class=3D"c21 c18 li-bullet-0"><span class=3D"=
c1">For a specific term, any node should vote for only one candidate.</span=
></li><li class=3D"c21 c18 li-bullet-0"><span class=3D"c1">A node votes for=
 a candidate only when certain conditions are met. Please refer to the pseu=
do-code for more information.</span></li></ol><p class=3D"c21 c22 c45"><spa=
n class=3D"c1"></span></p><ol class=3D"c0 lst-kix_fpy1luvoz4gw-0" start=3D"=
3"><li class=3D"c10 li-bullet-0"><span class=3D"c2">Leader State</span></li=
></ol><ol class=3D"c0 lst-kix_fpy1luvoz4gw-1 start" start=3D"1"><li class=
=3D"c13 c18 li-bullet-0"><span class=3D"c1">If a candidate node receives a =
majority of votes, it moves to the Leader state. </span></li><li class=3D"c=
12 c18 li-bullet-0"><span class=3D"c1 c20">Any new leader must also wait fo=
