_jft9gay2o8id-0" start=3D"2"><li class=3D"c10 li-bullet-0"><span class=3D"c=
2">Follower Committing an Entry</span></li></ol><ol class=3D"c0 lst-kix_jft=
9gay2o8id-1 start" start=3D"1"><li class=3D"c21 c18 li-bullet-0"><span>Foll=
ower nodes should use the LeaderCommit field in the AppendEntry RPC they re=
ceive in each heartbeat to commit entries.</span></li></ol><p class=3D"c9">=
<span class=3D"c1"></span></p><h2 class=3D"c30" id=3D"h.1tvtuq3xky32"><span=
 class=3D"c6">8</span><span class=3D"c6">. Print Statements &amp; Dump.txt<=
/span></h2><p class=3D"c13"><span>Add print statements wherever necessary t=
