a node </span><span class=3D"c6">grants</span><span>&nbsp;a vote to a candi=
date in a particular term:<br></span><span class=3D"c1 c25">"Vote granted f=
or Node {Candidate NodeID} in term {term of the vote}."</span></li><li clas=
